E AX3073 1004-undeclared-unsafe.ax:16:13-20 undeclared-unsafe "`main` touches raw memory and its declaration does not say so" #"__alloc" ?15:1:"write `;@axiom:effect(unsafe)` above the declaration"~>";@axiom:effect(unsafe)\n" ?"this fires where the primitive is CALLED, not up the call chain: a wrapper contains the unsafety, and a caller inherits `Unsafe` in its row without drawing this itself. If the raw access is not wanted here the fix is to stop performing it, not to stop saying so"
